abstract: >-
  An open-source AI fitness coaching skill for intermediate and advanced trainees.
  Combines strength training, cardio, nutrition and meal prep with independent
  AI review of proposed changes and a portable Training Record. Host tools and
  permissions determine available review, memory and integration capabilities.
